===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[non-Euclidean]] [[geometry]]|non-Euclidean geometries}}

# {{label|en|geometry}} Any system of geometry not based on the set of [[axiom]]s of [[Euclidean geometry]], which is based on the [[three-dimensional]] [[space]] of common experience.

====Antonyms====
* [[Euclidean geometry]]

